# Test suites and CI-only values. `helm package` packs everything not listed
# here, and the published client-1.9.107.tgz carried 41 helm-unittest suites
# plus ci/*-values.yaml -- 45 of its 96 entries, 39 % of its bytes. Nothing
# reads them from the tarball: `helm unittest ./client` and the ct/lint jobs
# run on the source checkout (helm-unittest's own README says to list `tests`
# here). scripts/check-chart-contents.sh refuses a packaged chart that carries
# either directory, so this rule is held by the artefact, not by this comment.
# Helm's own `templates/tests/` hook convention is unaffected: only the
# chart-root directories are listed.
tests/
ci/
